I am standing at the bus stop.
There are many people there.
A red city bus comes.
I get on the bus.
The bus is very crowded.
The conductor is standing near me.
I ask him.
"Does this bus go to Ernakulam?"
"Does it go to Marine Drive?"
The conductor nods his head.
"Yes, it goes," he says.
"You go inside," he says.
"Walk straight."
"Sit in a seat," he tells me.
I walk straight.
I see an empty seat.
I sit in that seat.
The bus moves forward.
